{"id":"5040","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5040_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-pileus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>远处有一大群积雨云的细胞。云被识别为积雨云，因为上部变得<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">模糊不清和扁平</span>，外观成白色，没有清晰的轮廓。</p>\n<p>一部分上部具有卷云状部分，其具有明显<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">纤维状的结构</span>，呈现无序的毛发状。这将其确定为鬃状云云种，无序的毛发状是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状</span>附加特征。可以看到附着在主细胞上及上方的几个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">伞状“帽”云</span>。</p>\n<p>存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性高积云</span>、以及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云和碎积云</span>；<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>；以及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波状毛卷层云</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alex Ngai","location":"中国香港大澳","latitude":"纬度: 22° 15' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 51' 36'' E","date":"21 July 2013 1739 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.24","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.24"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5040_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-pileus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这一天，南中国海北部一道宽阔的低压槽给中国广东沿海带来了不稳定的天气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5040_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-pileus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>低层和中层有条件地不稳定，从表面到对流层顶的水分含量高</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}